menu "Example Configuration"

    config EXAMPLE_RUN_OVERHEAD_MEASUREMENT
        bool "Run NVS blob storage-overhead measurement"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the example sweeps several partition size / blob size
            combinations. For each combination it pre-populates every NVS page
            with strings up to a set of population levels, writes a single blob
            and reports its ideal vs. real entry consumption (and the resulting
            overhead) in a table.

endmenu
